red."},{"day":62,"text":"THE HERALD located. The coalition must answer."},{"day":60,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":60,"text":"Ratings stunt delivered — the numbers ticked up."},{"day":53,"text":"Titan omen: something stirs."},{"day":47,"text":"Marisol Rosales claimed the relay."},{"day":47,"text":"Taught the System something it didn't know."},{"day":46,"text":"Haven entered Arc IV."},{"day":45,"text":"David, Nikos brought down Pack-leader Sunbasker, Sunbasker (packmate). Together."},{"day":41,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":36,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":30,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":26,"text":"Haven feels close-knit."},{"day":23,"text":"David, Ayaulym, Miguel brought down The Paparazzo. Together."},{"day":23,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":23,"text":"Taught the System something it didn't know."},{"day":21,"text":"David, Ayaulym, Miguel brought down Nostalgia. Together."},{"day":21,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":20,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":14,"text":"Haven entered Arc III."},{"day":14,"text":"David brought down ducks in a row (head), ducks in a row (head), ducks in a row (head), ducks in a row (head), ducks in a row (head), ducks "},{"day":14,"text":"Crisis survived: THE BREACH."},{"day":14,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":14,"text":"Taught the System something it didn't know."},{"day":11,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":11,"text":"Crisis survived: THE FIRST GRAVE."},{"day":9,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":8,"text":"Haven entered Arc II."},{"day":6,"text":"The village has decided what kind of keeper you are."}],"pendingMoments":[],"legendBeats":[{"day":4,"kind":"lived","dim":"foodShared","text":"A mother from Stonebridge pressed a carved token into your hand: \"for the winter you fed us.\" You didn't know there was a winter you'd fed."},{"day":8,"kind":"system","dim":"embrace","text":"The overlay's tone has changed around you. Warmer. It notices you noticing."},{"day":8,"kind":"gossip","dim":"foodShared","text":"You overhear it at the fire, and stop pretending not to listen. Riders say your name the way people say \"harvest.\""},{"day":9,"kind":"system","dim":"embrace","text":"🌟 \"We ask your opinion before we act now.\" The System says it like a confession. \"That is not normal. That is not nothing.\""},{"day":9,"kind":"show","dim":"showmanship","text":"📺 The audience has a favorite, and it's you. The chant doesn't have words. It doesn't need them."},{"day":12,"kind":"show","dim":"foodShared","text":"📺 The broadcast ran the numbers: how much of Haven's food left Haven in your hands. The audience went quiet — the good kind of quiet."},{"day":14,"kind":"gossip","dim":"might","text":"Riders from Emberhold are telling the deer story again — with your name attached this time."},{"day":14,"kind":"show","dim":"might","text":"📺 The show has started calling you \"the strong one of Haven.\" They play the deer footage underneath, whether you want them to or not."},{"day":14,"kind":"lived","dim":"might","text":"You notice the village gives you room on the path now. Not fear, exactly. Room."},{"day":16,"kind":"witness","dim":"exposed","text":"People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one."},{"day":28,"kind":"lived","dim":"protected","text":"A child drew you on the haven wall. You're very tall, and there are a lot of teeth on the other side."},{"day":36,"kind":"show","dim":"showmanship","text":"📺 Strangers paint your face on their walls. In other villages. Villages you've never been to."},{"day":49,"kind":"gossip","dim":"protected","text":"In Emberhold, mothers tell the story of the n