e village dug the grave."},{"day":75,"text":"Haven feels as one."},{"day":74,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":74,"text":"David Kim died. Ben picked up the Codex."},{"day":72,"text":"THE HERALD struck unanswered."},{"day":70,"text":"Marisol Rosales was brought home. The village dug the grave."},{"day":69,"text":"Marisol Rosales died. David picked up the Codex."},{"day":67,"text":"THE HERALD struck unanswered."},{"day":66,"text":"Planted: wrong pauses in the north village's messages."},{"day":66,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":65,"text":"Shared food outward — Haven's pantry."},{"day":62,"text":"War council sat for THE HERALD."},{"day":62,"text":"THE HERALD struck unanswered."},{"day":62,"text":"THE HERALD located. The coalition must answer."},{"day":60,"text":"Survived the audience's trial: Haul 3,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days.."},{"day":60,"text":"Ratings stunt delivered — the numbers ticked up."}],"pendingMoments":[],"legendBeats":[{"day":4,"kind":"lived","dim":"foodShared","text":"A mother from Stonebridge pressed a carved token into your hand: \"for the winter you fed us.\" You didn't know there was a winter you'd fed."},{"day":8,"kind":"system","dim":"embrace","text":"The overlay's tone has changed around you. Warmer. It notices you noticing."},{"day":8,"kind":"gossip","dim":"foodShared","text":"You overhear it at the fire, and stop pretending not to listen. Riders say your name the way people say \"harvest.\""},{"day":9,"kind":"system","dim":"embrace","text":"🌟 \"We ask your opinion before we act now.\" The System says it like a confession. \"That is not normal. That is not nothing.\""},{"day":9,"kind":"show","dim":"showmanship","text":"📺 The audience has a favorite, and it's you. The chant doesn't have words. It doesn't need them."},{"day":12,"kind":"show","dim":"foodShared","text":"📺 The broadcast ran the numbers: how much of Haven's food left Haven in your hands. The audience went quiet — the good kind of quiet."},{"day":14,"kind":"gossip","dim":"might","text":"Riders from Emberhold are telling the deer story again — with your name attached this time."},{"day":14,"kind":"show","dim":"might","text":"📺 The show has started calling you \"the strong one of Haven.\" They play the deer footage underneath, whether you want them to or not."},{"day":14,"kind":"lived","dim":"might","text":"You notice the village gives you room on the path now. Not fear, exactly. Room."},{"day":16,"kind":"witness","dim":"exposed","text":"People bring you their suspicions, written down. You keep every one."},{"day":28,"kind":"lived","dim":"protected","text":"A child drew you on the haven wall. You're very tall, and there are a lot of teeth on the other side."},{"day":36,"kind":"show","dim":"showmanship","text":"📺 Strangers paint your face on their walls. In other villages. Villages you've never been to."},{"day":49,"kind":"gossip","dim":"protected","text":"In Emberhold, mothers tell the story of the night you stood between. The children ask for it by name."},{"day":49,"kind":"system","dim":"defiance","text":"The System's messages have gotten careful around you. It chooses its words the way you choose footing on ice."}],"lastStage":3,"selfTalkedAbout":true,"lastArcDay":46,"namedMonsterGrants":{"lockpick_raccoon":true,"hummice":true,"ducks_in_a_row":true,"nevermore":true,"hushwolf":true,"alien_tick":true,"memory_projector":true,"paparazzo":true,"buffering":true,"nightlight_catfish":true,"eater":true,"ad_break":true,"sunbasker":true,"heckler":true,"congregation":true,"cancellation":true,"timeslot":true,"glasswing":true},"feastSurge":1.5,"lastLedgerBeat":72,"s